570","kind":"update","title":"🏹Beta Weekend + Next Fest Demo Patch Notes","summary":"Punch Upon A Time is running its FINAL public demo starting THIS weekend on Saturday October 17th, then continuing all through Next Fest until it ends on Monday, October 26th. Fear not though:🎉Punch Upon A Time releases into Early Access on Monday October, 26th!Check out the video below to learn more about the latest character, Robin Hood, and what else is in store for Early Access and beyond. Or for a more detailed text-only version of the patch notes for the demo build, read on below!🆕 NEW CHA","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T20:02:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682959","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4485570-1844115010495885","game_id":"steam-4485570","kind":"update","title":"Punch Upon A Time Beta Weekend 3 Patch Notes","summary":"Game Demo Publicly Available All Weekend 9/19-9/20!General🚧Versus Screen overhaul is in-progress! What you'll see this weekend is in a bit of a halfway state. More polish / improvements to come.Voice Chat has been added to lobbies. By default when joining a lobby you will be put into a voice chat with all other players in the lobby.2v2 Brawl queue has been removed.Players can now queue directly into Skirmish.A 📶Ping Indicator will now appear next to a player's portrait when their ping is high.Ye","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T19:42:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495885","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4485570-1842846814444711","game_id":"steam-4485570","kind":"update","title":"Punch Upon A Time Beta Weekend 2 Patch Notes","s